WEBVTT

00:10:57.053 --> 00:11:00.356
That layer of support
is incredibly important.

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:02.325
It's important for everyone.

00:11:02.358 --> 00:11:04.327
But if you're a member of a social group

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:07.664
that contends with these kinds of
challenges in society,

00:11:07.664 --> 00:11:10.400
that layer of support
that you can go after

00:11:10.433 --> 00:11:13.203
in terms of creating
robust social networks,

00:11:13.203 --> 00:11:14.837
that is a key.

00:11:14.837 --> 00:11:16.806
CSB: This has been so valuable, Valerie.

00:11:16.806 --> 00:11:19.475
Thank you so much
for taking the time to talk with me.

00:11:19.509 --> 00:11:20.843
VPG: Thank you so much.